For SwiftUI performance work, read the `swiftui-perf` skill (`SKILL.md` in `.cursor/skills/swiftui-perf/`, `.agents/skills/swiftui-perf/` or `~/.cursor/skills/swiftui-perf/`) and follow its phase router.

- Run setup first if `.swiftui-perf.json` does not exist.
- Measure before and after; change one variable per run.
- Simulator numbers are relative only.
- Revert the marker patch before any commit.
